<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25906" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Lārīnum</span></b> , i,
			n., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a town of Samnium, in the territory of the</i> Frentani, <i>near</i> Teanum, now <i>Larino</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Cic.
				Att. 7, 13, 7</span></i>; <i><span class="en">7, 13, 6</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Clu. 8,
				27</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Mel. 2, 4</span></i>.—Hence,
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Lārī-nas</span></b> ,
				ātis, <i>adj., of</i> or
				<i>belonging to the town of Larinum</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Larinas socrus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. Clu. 7</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">municipium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 5</span></i>
			.—In <i>plur. subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Lā-rīnātes</span></b> ,
			ium, m., <i>inhabitants of
				Larinum</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in foro Larinatium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Clu. 13, 38</span></i>
			.</div>
